  "description": "Eremex.Avalonia.Controls is a suite of advanced UI components for the Avalonia UI framework: DataGrid, TreeList and TreeView, PropertyGrid, ListView, Charts (Cartesian, Polar and Smith), Heatmap, Ribbon, Visual Studio-style Docking, Toolbars and Menus, and a full set of data editors. Build high-performance, data-rich, cross-platform desktop applications for Windows, Linux (including Astra Linux and ALT Linux) and macOS, with sorting, grouping, filtering, data virtualization, drag-and-drop, validation, MVVM support and light/dark themes.",
